# Secret token(s) that lock this proxy, comma-separated so you can rotate
# (add the new one, update your devices, remove the old one).
#
# The Deploy to Cloudflare button prompts for this value. If you leave it
# blank the worker is not configured: it serves a setup page with a freshly
# generated token and refuses to proxy anything (it never falls back to open).
#
# Generate one with: openssl rand -hex 24
PROXY_TOKENS=
